    "Home",
    "Centene is committed to providing accessible digital experiences in accordance with federal laws, such as the Americans with Disabilities ActExternal Link and Section 508 of the Rehabilitation ActExternal Link, and state laws such as the Unruh Act of CaliforniaExternal Link and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA)External Link. Centene demonstrates that commitment through the adoption of and meaningful conformance with the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 levels A and AAExternal Link.",
    "We welcome your feedback on our digital accessibility efforts. Please contact us at accessibility@centene.com. Emails are generally responded to within 3 business days.",
    "Some Centene websites may contain links to web pages owned and operated by third parties. Centene does not guarantee the accessibility of those third-party sites. For more information, view our legal disclaimer.",
    "For callers with hearing disabilities, please dial 711 and follow the prompts.",
    "For job applicants who need assistance when applying for a job at Centene, please contact the Workplace Accommodations team at 1-833-462-7547.",
